摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A DeepSeek Harness bundle reimplementing opengsd-core (Git Ship Done) as host-plane Cordis plugins, replacing the default agent-loop behaviour with the GSD phase loop.","id":"gh:1343392656","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-gsd-bundle","slug":"jaaty/dsh-gsd-bundle","topics":["coding-agent","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-bundle","git-ship-done","gsd","opengsd","plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness bundle reimplementing opengsd-core (Git Ship Done) as host-plane Cordis plugins, "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"replacing the default agent-loop behaviour with the GSD phase loop."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-gsd-bundle\n[](https://github.com/jaaty/dsh-gsd-bundle/actions/workflows/ci.yml) [](https://git"},{"id":"p2s2","text":"hub.com/jaaty/dsh-gsd-bundle/blob/main/LICENSE) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@dsh-gsd/bundle)"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A **plugin bundle for DeepSeek Harness** (dsh) that reimplements opengsd-core — **Git Ship Done (GSD"},{"id":"p3s2","text":")** — as a set of host-plane Cordis plugins. It replaces the default agent-loop behaviour with the G"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"SD phase loop, so every session becomes a disciplined, artefact-driven engineering loop."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Every unit of work is a **phase** that moves through these steps in order, wrapped by advisory soft "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"gates (gap-analysis after Plan, code-review and UI-review after Execute, validate before Ship). Stat"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"e survives across sessions and context resets on disk under `.planning/`, with `STATE.md` as the nav"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"igation spine. Heavy work (research, planning, execution, verification, review) runs in **fresh-cont"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"ext subagents** spawned by the orchestrator, so the main session stays lean."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Release status"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**Milestone `core-loop-helpers` v3.1 is complete and released as `v3.1.0`** — this final 8-phase del"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ta (phases 52–59) completes the bundle's parity with upstream opengsd-core's command surface: phase "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"management, smart entry, freeform routing, quick batching, fast mode, MVP scoping, bounded node repa"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ir, and the rebuilt code-review fix companion. It follows the v3.0 `upstream-parity` milestone, whic"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"h brought the full upstream step surface (spec, gap-analysis, code-review, UI-review, validate, undo"},{"id":"p7s6","text":", health, milestone-audit, learnings, graphify, mempalace, assumption-delta, pause/resume-work, auto"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"nomous, add-tests, and the direct phase-branch clean-PR model). The earlier v2.2 `public-launch`, v2"},{"id":"p7s8","text":".1 `public-release-readiness`, v2.0 `graceful-removal`, and v1.7 `job-intel-multiwindow` milestones "},{"id":"p7s9","text":"remain prior releases. The surface today: **28 Cordis plugin rows** (1 override + 27 inserts), **37 "},{"id":"p7s10","text":"`gsd_*` tools**, and **34 `/gsd-*` commands** — all proven by the mount and per-plugin removal suite"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"sd_*` tools**, and **34 `/gsd-*` commands** — all proven by the mount and per-plugin removal suites."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### v3.1 release note — core-loop-helpers"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The v3.1 milestone adds eight core-loop helper commands, completing the phase-loop tooling surface. "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"stone adds eight core-loop helper commands, completing the phase-loop tooling surface. It delivered:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **Phase-management** — `gsd_phase` (`/gsd-phase-manage`): add, insert, remove, reorder, and edit p"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"hases directly in `ROADMAP.md` with validation and integrity checks; `ROADMAP.md`, its `## Progress`"},{"id":"p10s3","text":" table, and `STATE.md` progress stay consistent and commit atomically.\n- **Smart-entry** — `gsd_next"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"` (`/gsd-next`): detect the current project state and route to the best next action, with an auto-ad"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"vance option.\n- **Freeform-routing** — `gsd_route` (`/gsd-route`): parse a plain-English intent and "},{"id":"p10s6","text":"dispatch it to the most appropriate GSD command — recommend-only; never auto-runs.\n- **Quick-batch**"},{"id":"p10s7","text":" — `gsd_quick_batch` (`/gsd-quick-batch`): run multiple quick tasks in a single batch with per-task "},{"id":"p10s8","text":"results and failure isolation.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**The phase loop, as model-facing tools:**"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- **Spec → Discuss → (UI) → Plan → Execute → Verify → Ship** — every step is a tool: `gsd_spec_phase"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"` (optional falsifiable SPEC.md), `gsd_discuss` (CONTEXT.md), `gsd_ui_phase` (UI-SPEC.md), `gsd_plan"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"` (researcher → planner → plan-checker, dependency waves), `gsd_execute` (fresh-context executors, a"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"tomic commits, checkpoint-resume), `gsd_verify` (VERIFICATION.md + status routing), `gsd_ship` (pref"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"light, capability gates, pre-ship-verify, PR).\n- **Advisory soft gates around the loop** — `gsd_gap_"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"analysis` (post-plan coverage table), `gsd_code_review` (REVIEW.md, with an optional `--fix` compani"},{"id":"p13s7","text":"on that applies findings as per-fix atomic commits into REVIEW-FIX.md), `gsd_ui_review` (6-pillar UI"},{"id":"p13s8","text":" audit), `gsd_validate_phase` (requirement→test coverage audit). Each is gated by its own `workflow."},{"id":"p13s9","text":"*` config flag and never blocks the next loop step.\n- **Bounded auto-recovery** — `gsd_repair` runs "},{"id":"p13s10","text":"up to 2 rounds of plan(gaps) → execute(gaps-only) → verify(gaps) for a phase whose verification foun"},{"id":"p13s11","text":"d gaps, stopping with clear causes on anything it cannot recover from.\n- **Autonomous path** — `gsd_"},{"id":"p13s12","text":"autonomous` drives all remaining incomplete phases of the active milestone end-to-end (auto-deriving"},{"id":"p13s13","text":" CONTEXT when absent) and reports a per-phase STATUS; it stops on a hard failure, never ships, and n"},{"id":"p13s14","text":"ever runs milestone lifecycle.\n- **Orientation helpers** — `gsd_init`, `gsd_status`, `gsd_progress`,"},{"id":"p13s15","text":" `gsd_next` (state detection + next-action routing, with auto-advance), `gsd_route` (recommend-only "},{"id":"p13s16","text":"plain-English intent dispatch), `gsd_progress`, and `gsd_new_milestone`.\n- **Sub-threshold quick pat"},{"id":"p13s17","text":"h** — `gsd_quick` for single-turn tasks, plus `gsd_quick_batch` for many with failure isolation, `gs"},{"id":"p13s18","text":"d_fast_mode` for simple phases, and `gsd_mvp_phase` for propose-then-confirm minimal-viable scoping."},{"id":"p13s19","text":"de` for simple phases, and `gsd_mvp_phase` for propose-then-confirm minimal-viable scoping.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Prerequisites"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- **DeepSeek Harness (dsh)** with the `dsh` CLI available on `PATH`.\n- **Node.js ≥ 20** (declared vi"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"a the package's `engines` field).\n- A **git** repository for the project you want to drive with GSD "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"(the loop commits atomically and ships PRs via the `gh` CLI).\n- The **GitHub CLI (`gh`)** installed "},{"id":"p15s4","text":"and authenticated if you want `gsd_ship` to create pull requests."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### What \"replace the default agent loop plugin\" means"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The mechanical turn machine in `@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-loop` (tool scheduling, context assembly, ses"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"sion preparation) **stays** — that is DeepSeek Harness's core runtime, and a session cannot run with"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"out it. The bundle replaces the agent loop's *behaviour*:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- `cordis.patch.yml` overrides the host `agent-loop` row's `config` (last-write-wins per row), repla"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"cing `agents: []` with a configured **`gsd`** agent.\n- `gsd-persona` installs opengsd's phase-loop m"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ental model as the system-prompt section every session reads (order -100, before the deployment pers"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"ona) and a runtime-context contribution that orients every model step at the current `STATE.md` posi"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"tion.\n- The `gsd_*` phase tools are the loop steps."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
